---
description: Extra rules for the Go bidder hot path
globs: services/bidder/**
alwaysApply: false
---
This is the bid path. Decision time (the `X-DSP-Decision-Us` response header) must stay under 1000µs. The average today is about 41µs.

- Request handling gets its data from the in-memory snapshot and the budget cache only. Add no new network calls, DB clients, disk reads or LLM calls there.
- Log through the existing async logger (`internal/logasync`). Never log in a way that blocks.
- Follow the existing low-allocation patterns (see `internal/openrtb/fast.go`). Don't add per-request allocations they avoid.
- Every change here needs `go test ./...` to pass. If it touches matching, pricing or budget, add a case to `internal/matcher/matcher_test.go`.
- In the Builder report, give the avg and max decision time from `/health` before and after the change.
